      "raw": "I couldn't help but notice that Setback's backstory mentions that all of his hair fell out after Blade's treatment, but nothing is said of it growing back.\r\n\r\nWe can't see any eyebrows due to his mask, but he seems to have a head full of spiky brown hair. I don't know that we have any pictures of him pretreatment. We do know that his luck deals in extremes, so I could see him not getting his hair back. That leaves me with a few questions...\r\n\r\n1. Is that a wig or Setback's own regrown hair?\r\n2. If not, is that what his hair looked like before it fell out?",
