      "created_at": "2014-03-12T15:35:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's not a wig, and it never grew back. &nbsp;It's just that, by PURE RANDOM CHANCE, every single piece of art in Setback's deck (except for Silver Lining) is of a time when a collection of leaves/pieces of brown lint/very confused mice/whatever happens to be either falling or getting blown past him at&nbsp;<em>just</em> the right angle.</p>",
